lternatively, approximate the numbers:\n\n522 million is about 500 million, and 870 million is about 900 million. Adding them gives roughly 1.4 billion. The exact answer is 1.392..., which aligns with that approximation. So that's a good check.\n\nTherefore, I'm confident the sum is 1,392,670,013.\n\n"]  1%|1         | 7/500 [07:06<8:58:41, 65.56s/it]
