each part:\n\nBillions:400M +800M =1,200M\n\n27M +54M =81M → total so far 1,281M\n\n800k +700k =1,500k =1.5M → total 1,282.5M\n\n50k +24k =74k → 1,282,574,000?\n\nWait, maybe this is getting too convoluted. Alternatively, perhaps using calculator-like steps, but since I can't use a calculator, I'll trust the two methods above that both led me to 1,282,577,104. So I think that's the correct answer.\n"]
