the number is 1 (billions), 6 (hundred millions),7 (ten millions),4 (millions),9 (hundred thousands),9 (ten thousands),9 (thousands),2 (hundreds),1 (tens),0 (ones). So 1,674,999,210.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 1,674,999,210. The initial mistake was in the thousands place where I incorrectly added 8 +5 instead of 8 +1. After correcting that, the answer comes out correctly.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 877728158 and 797271052 is \\boxed{1674999210}.\n"]
