carry) = 6  \n8. The ten millions place: 2 + 1 = 3  \n9. The hundred millions place: 3 + 7 = 10 (write 0, carry over 1)  \n10. The billions place: 1 (carry)  \n\nAnswer:  \nTherefore, the final computed sum is **1036599997**.",
