8,761,354\n\nAdding them:\n\nLet me add the millions first.\n\n500,000,000 + 300,000,000 = 800,000,000.\n\n77,000,000 + 58,000,000 = 135,000,000. Adding to the previous total: 800M +135M = 935M.\n\nNow the next part: 788,000 (from first number) + 761,000 (from second) = 1,549,000. Adding to 935M gives 936,549,000.\n\nThen the last part: 174 + 354 = 528. So total is 936,549,528. Okay, that matches the previous result.\n\nSo the answer should be 936,549,528. I think that's correct. I'll go with that.\n</think>\n\n",
