ce (billions):.\n\n1 (billion), 6 (hundred millions), 9 (ten millions), 0 (millions), 5 (hundred thousands), 1 (ten thousands), 8 (thousands), 3 (hundred), 9 (tens), 7 (ones). So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
