usands):0 +7=7.\n\nPosition6 (millions):3 +4=7.\n\nPosition7 (ten millions):2 +5=7.\n\nPosition8 (hundred millions):3 +3=6.\n\nWait, so putting it all together:.\n\nStarting from position0 to position8:.\n\nPositions 0-8 results:7,7,6,2 (with carryover1 to next), then position4 is 5, position5 is7, position6 is7, position7 is7, position8 is6.\n\nWait, let me list each position's result step by step with carryover:.\n\nStarting from Position0:.\n\nPosition0: 0+7=7 → 7, carry 0.\n\nPosition1:2+5=7 →7, carry 0.\n\nPosition2:1+5=6 →6, carry0.\n\nPosition3:5+7=12 →2, carry1.\n\nPosition4:2+2=4 plus carry1 →5, carry0.\n\nPosition5:0+7=7 →7, carry0.\n\nPosition6:3+4=7 →7, carry0.\n\nPosition7:2+5=7 →7, carry0.\n\nPosition8:3+3=6 →6, carry0.\n\nSo the digits from position0 to position8 (right to left) are:7,7,6,2,5,7,7,7,6.\n\nWait, arranging them from highest position to lowest (left to right):.\n\nPosition8 (hundred millions):6.\n\nPosition7 (ten millions):7.\n\nPosition6 (millions):7.\n\nPosition5 (hundred thousands):7.\n\nPosition4 (ten thousands):5.\n\nPosition3 (thousands):2.\n\nPosition2 (hundreds):6.\n\nPosition1 (tens):7.\n\nPosition0 (ones):7.\n\nSo combining these digits: 6 (hundred millions),7 (ten millions),7 (millions),7 (hundred thousands),5 (ten thousands),2 (thousands),6 (hundreds),7 (tens),7 (ones).\n\nWait, let me write that out as a number:.\n\n6 (hundred millions place) → 600,000,000.\n\nThen 7 (ten millions) → 70,000,000 → total so far 670,000,000.\n\nNext 7 (millions) → +7,000,000 → 677,000,000.\n\nNext 7 (hundred thousands) → +700,000 → 677,700,000.\n\nThen 5 (ten thousands) → +50,000 → 677,750,000.\n\nThen 2 (thousands) → +2,000 → 677,752,000.\n\n6 (hundreds) → +600 → 677,752,600.\n\n7 (tens) → +70 → 677,752,670. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
