ts are 8,6,8,9,5,6,1,8,7 → 868,956,187. Correct.\n\nAlright, confident that's the right answer. So the steps in the reasoning would list each digit place addition, including the carryover from thousands to ten thousands. The other digits don't have any carryover except that one step. So the reasoning should mention each place step by step, noting the carryover where needed.\n"]
