ade a mistake in my initial digit-by-digit calculation earlier when I thought there was a carryover in the hundred thousands place. That was an error, but after rechecking properly, it's clear the correct sum is 1,054,952,284.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 163120034 and 891832250 is \\boxed{1054952284}.\n"]
