t me check with calculator steps:\n\n810,639,307 + 482,066,318.\n\nLet's compute 810,639,307 + 400,000,000 = 1,210,639,307.\n\nThen add 82,066,318: 1,210,639,307 + 82,066,318.\n\nAdding 80,000,000 gives 1,290,639,307.\n\nThen add 2,066,318: 1,290,639,307 + 2,066,318 = ?\n\n1,290,639,307 + 2,000,000 = 1,292,639,307.\n\nThen add 66,318: 1,292,639,307 + 66,318 = 1,292,705,625.\n\nYes, that matches. So the final answer is 1,292,705,625.\n\nTherefore, the steps in the reasoning should follow that digit-by-digit addition, making sure each place is correctly calculated with carries.\n</think>\n\n",
