, Position4:6, Position3:0, Position2:7, Position1:6.\n\nSo the number is 1,442,256,076. Hmm, that seems right. Let me confirm with another method. Maybe adding the numbers as whole:\n\n688,406,554 + 753,849,522.\n\nLet me add them step by step:\n\n688,406,554 + 700,000,000 = 1,388,406,554\n\nThen add 53,849,522: 1,388,406,554 +53,849,522.\n\nAdding 50,000,000 gives 1,438,406,554. Then 3,849,522 more:\n\n1,438,406,554 +3,849,522 = 1,442,256,076. Yes, same result. So the answer should be correct.\n"]
