\nAdding 607,930 + 900,000 = 1,507,930.\n\nThen add 25,610: 1,507,930 +25,610 = 1,533,540.\n\nTotal sum: 335,000,000 +1,533,540 = 336,533,540. That matches.\n\nTherefore, the final answer should be 336,533,540.\n\nWait, but in my first reasoning steps, I thought I had 336,535,430, which is different. So the mistake must have been in the initial digit-by-digit calculation when I was thinking through. But upon careful recheck, it's correct now.\n\nSo the answer is 336,533,540.\n\nTherefore, the final computed sum is 336,533,540.\n\nI should present this in the required template, filling in each step as per the example.\n"] 45%|####4     | 223/500 [5:08:29<6:31:29, 84.80s/it]
