pproach. Let's approximate the numbers:\n\n843,627,383 is approximately 843.627 million.\n\n421,656,752 is approximately 421.657 million.\n\nAdding them gives roughly 1,265.284 million, which aligns with the result 1,265,284,135. So that seems correct.\n\nTherefore, the reasoning steps as per the template should be filled in accordingly.\n</think>\n\n",
