from second). Adding the carried over 1: 8 + 1 + 1 = 10. So write 0 in the hundred millions place and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\nBut wait, there's no next column beyond hundred millions here. So that carried over 1 becomes a 1 in the billions place. So the final digit on the left is 1. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
