ver 1.\n\nMillions:0 +7 =7 plus the carried 1 makes 8.\n\nTen millions:2 +5=7.\n\nHundred millions:3 +5=8.\n\nSo yes, the total is 878,149,498.\n\nTherefore the final answer should be 878,149,498. Wait but let me check once more with another approach.\n\nAlternatively, 320,638,116 + 557,511,382.\n\nLet me break it into 320,638,116 + 500,000,000 = 820,638,116.\n\nThen add 57,511,382:\n\n820,638,116 + 57,511,382.\n\n820,638,116 +50,000,000 =870,638,116.\n\nThen add7,511,382: 870,638,116 +7,511,382.\n\n870,638,116 +7,000,000 =877,638,116.\n\nThen add 511,382: 877,638,116 +511,382.\n\nAdding 500,000 gives 878,138,116.\n\nThen 11,382 more: 878,138,116 +11,382 = 878,149,498. Yep, matches.\n\nSo the answer is correct. The sum is 878,149,498.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 320,638,116 and 557,511,382 is \\boxed{878149498}.\n"]
