e digits together from right to left:.\n\nThe digits collected are:.\n\nPosition1:0.\n\n2:1.\n\n3:3.\n\n4:4.\n\n5:6.\n\n6:3.\n\n7:2.\n\n8:3.\n\n9:9. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
