00,000 +90,000,000 +7,000,000 +400,000 +40,000 +4,000 +800 +50 +5.\n\nAdding each component:\n\n100M +700M =800M,\n\n20M+90M=110M,\n\n7M+7M=14M,\n\n300k+400k=700k,\n\n20k+40k=60k,\n\n2k+4k=6k,\n\n200+800=1000,\n\n80+50=130,\n\n6+5=11.\n\nNow add all those together:\n\n800,000,000 + 110,000,000 =910,000,000.\n\n910,000,000 +14,000,000 =924,000,000.\n\n924,000,000 +700,000 =924,700,000.\n\n924,700,000 +60,000 =924,760,000.\n\n924,760,000 +6,000 =924,766,000.\n\n924,766,000 +1,000 =924,767,000.\n\n924,767,000 +130 =924,767,130.\n\n924,767,130 +11 =924,767,141.\n\nYes, that matches the previous result. So the sum is indeed 924,767,141. Therefore, the final answer should be that.\n</think>\n\n",
