 4 (ten thousands),5 (hundred thousands),7 (millions),4 (ten millions),6 (hundred millions), and the final carryover 1 in the billions place.\n\nSo the digits are:.\n\nBillions:1, Hundred millions:6, Ten millions:4, Millions:7, Hundred thousands:5, Ten thousands:4, Thousands:0, Hundreds:0, Tens:1, Ones:5. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
