 is 1,331,916,711.\n\nWait, but in the digit breakdown earlier, I had the same result. So the answer should be 1,331,916,711. Let me confirm once more with another approach, perhaps breaking into parts.\n\nAlternatively, adding 457,228,733 + 874,687,978:\n\nLet me add the millions first:\n\n457 million + 874 million = 1,331 million.\n\nThen the remaining parts:\n\n228,733 + 687,978 = ?\n\n228,733 + 600,000 = 828,733.\n\nThen +87,978: 828,733 +87,978 = 916,711.\n\nSo total is 1,331,000,000 + 916,711 = 1,331,916,711. Yep, that's the same.\n\nTherefore, the sum is indeed 1,331,916,711.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe final computed sum is \\boxed{1331916711}.\n"]
