y over 1.\n4. **Thousands place**: \\(9 + 1 + 1 = 11\\). Write down 1, carry over 1.\n5. **Ten-thousands place**: \\(0 + 3 + 1 = 4\\). Write down 4, no carryover.\n6. **Hundred-thousands place**: \\(9 + 8 = 17\\). Write down 7, carry over 1.\n7. **Millions place**: \\(9 + 8 + 1 = 18\\). Write down 8, carry over 1.\n8. **Ten-millions place**: \\(3 + 9 + 1 = 13\\). Write down 3, carry over 1.\n9. **Hundred-millions place**: \\(7 + 1 + 1 = 9\\). Write down 9, no carryover.\n\nPutting all the digits together, we get the final sum: 938,741,322.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{938741322}\n\\]",
