lace: \\(7 + 0 = 7\\)\n9. The hundred-millions place: \\(4 + 1 = 5\\)\n\nPutting all the digits together from highest to lowest place value:\n- Hundred millions: \\(5\\)\n- Ten millions: \\(7\\)\n- Millions: \\(3\\)\n- Hundred thousands: \\(2\\)\n- Ten thousands: \\(9\\)\n- Thousands: \\(9\\)\n- Hundreds: \\(9\\)\n- Tens: \\(4\\)\n- Ones: \\(8\\)\n\nTherefore, the final computed sum is \\(\\boxed{573299948}\\).",
