\n\n269,540,554 + 152,139,612:\n\nFirst, 269,540,554 + 150,000,000 = 419,540,554.\n\nThen add the remaining 2,139,612: 419,540,554 + 2,139,612 = 421,680,166. Yes, that matches. So the answer is 421,680,166.\n\nTherefore, the reasoning steps should follow the digit-by-digit addition with carries as above.\n"]
