 me add the millions first:\n\n226 million + 711 million = 937 million.\n\nThen the remaining parts:\n\n778,339 + 290,426.\n\n778,339 + 290,426:\n\n700,000 + 200,000 = 900,000,\n\n78,339 + 90,426 = 168,765.\n\nSo total: 900,000 + 168,765 = 1,068,765.\n\nAdding to the 937 million:\n\n937,000,000 + 1,068,765 = 938,068,765.\n\nYes, same result. So the answer is correct.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 226778339 and 711290426 is \\boxed{938068765}.\n"]
