ousand 477.\n\n913,273,174 is 913 million plus 273 thousand 174.\n\nAdding the millions: 728 + 913 = 1,641 million.\n\nAdding the thousands: 931 + 273 = 1,204 thousand.\n\nAdding the remaining: 477 +174 = 651.\n\nSo total is 1,641,000,000 + 1,204,000 + 651 = 1,642,204,651. Yes, that matches. So the answer is correct.\n\nSo the reasoning steps should reflect each digit's addition with carryovers leading to the final result.\n"]
